I think simplest and matching the spec: profile is a root Stack screen presented above the drawer with a standard header. Let me go with that. Actually the spec says "Profile screen: new route showing avatar/initials, name, email. Placeholder — no settings editing." Root stack is fine.

Hmm wait, but the root _layout Stack currently has headerShown: false for all. If profile is a Stack screen, I can set headerShown true just for profile. Good.

