Let me now also confirm the `(drawer)` group: with `Drawer` from `expo-router/drawer`, the layout file is `(drawer)/_layout.tsx` returning `<Drawer>`. And screens are the files in the group. We have `(tabs)` inside. And the root Stack has `(drawer)` as a screen.

